Modifications
-------------

The shipped `.ko` is byte-identical to the official v3.3.1 asset. No changes
were made to the KernelSU source in this repository.

At runtime, RootKit's MIT-licensed tools modify the loaded image:

- `tools/ksupatch.c` rewrites undefined symbol entries to `SHN_ABS` addresses
  from the target kernel's symbol table.
- `tools/modload.c` calls `finit_module`.

These tools are not part of KernelSU and are not required to build the LKM.

Target kernel symbol data
-------------------------

`assets/kallsyms_6.12.58.bin.gz` is generated from the target device's
`/proc/kallsyms` and is used only for symbol resolution. It is not part of
KernelSU. The corresponding kernel source is available from the device
vendor's GPL source release.

